  "body": "While writing tests for #8428 I needed to use `ResizeObserver` to detect when the poster image is loaded, because there are no events fired for the poster image being loaded or failing to load.\r\n\r\nIf you specify the correct dimensions with `<video width height>` then it's not possible to use `ResizeObserver`, either.\r\n\r\nWould it be useful for web developers to have events here? e.g. `posterload` and `postererror`.\r\n\r\ncc @whatwg/media",
